;
; NOTE, recorded not repaired: several rule names here COLLIDE with rules
; of the same name in cdn.abnf and carry DIFFERENT definitions.  In
; Figure 1, `non-lf = %x09 / %x0D / %x20-7F / NONASCII`; here it is
; `non-lf = %x20-7f / NONASCII`.  The two grammars are separate parsers
; (Figure 1 parses CDN source; these parse the DECODED content of a
; string literal), but the draft does not namespace them.
